[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17160.67, "timestamp": "04:46:00", "text": "所以，这些是孩子们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17163.47, "timestamp": "04:46:03", "text": "太阳。所以你就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17166.03, "timestamp": "04:46:06", "text": "领导者。你是领导者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17169.03, "timestamp": "04:46:09", "text": "不，你以为我可以吗？我会称你为上帝，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17173.09, "timestamp": "04:46:13", "text": "儿子或儿子的女神。是的。你好，布拉德。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17174.27, "timestamp": "04:46:14", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17177.868, "timestamp": "04:46:17", "text": "欢迎。而这里是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17187.2, "timestamp": "04:46:27", "text": "哇。我打开的时候出错了。比如像这样的事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17207.91, "timestamp": "04:46:47", "text": "它。我们得到了一个黑色边缘。那是金子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17210.59, "timestamp": "04:46:50", "text": "武器。火焰刺击。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17212.43, "timestamp": "04:46:52", "text": "好的。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17214.03, "timestamp": "04:46:54", "text": "有趣的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17216.708, "timestamp": "04:46:56", "text": "等等，就是这样。我以为我会解锁"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17219.07, "timestamp": "04:46:59", "text": "某种东西，但是"}]